# Project Design Phase

## Project Name
Skill-wallet

## System Design

The Skill-wallet system is designed as a web-based application.

## Main Components

### Frontend
The frontend provides the user interface through which users interact with the application.

### Backend
The backend processes user requests and manages application logic.

### Database
The database stores user and skill-related information.

## Basic System Flow

User
↓
Frontend
↓
Backend
↓
Database
↓
Backend
↓
Frontend
↓
User

## Modules

- User Authentication
- User Profile
- Skill Management
- Skill Tracking
- Dashboard

## Design Goal

To create a simple, organized and user-friendly skill management system.
